/given-names></name><name><surname>Baba</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ezaki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kimura</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Emergence of multidrug-resistant Corynebacterium striatum as a nosocomial pathogen in a long-term hospitalized patients with underlying diseases</article-title><source>Diag Microbiol Infect Dis</source><year>2006</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>109</fpage><lpage>14</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.diagmicrobio.2005.08.005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Renom</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Garau</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramis</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Galmes</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Sorano</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nosocomial outbreak of Corynebacterium striatum Infection in Patients with Chonic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease</article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>45</volume><fpage>2064</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17409213</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JCM.00152-07</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>